.TH RUST-TOOLCHAIN 1 "2026-08-19" "PGSTY" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rust-toolchain \- run a command with the current PGSTY Rust toolchain
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rust-toolchain
.I command
.RI [ arguments ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rust-toolchain
prepends the private PGSTY Rust binary directory to PATH and executes the
requested command. It does not change the system Rust toolchain or rustup
configuration.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B rust-toolchain rustc -vV
Display compiler build information.
.TP
.B rust-toolchain cargo build --locked
Build the current Cargo project with the packaged toolchain.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/lib/pgsty/rust
Current PGSTY Rust toolchain root.
